        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** IMMACULATE 2 BEDROOM / 1 BATHROOM MID-TERRACE HOME *** REGISTER YOUR INTEREST TODAY ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this immaculate two-bedroom, one-bathroom mid-terrace home to the rental market, ideally located in the ever-popular St. Anne's development, Kimmage, Dublin 12.\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this bright and spacious property offers well-proportioned living accommodation finished to a high standard. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room, a modern fully fitted kitchen with ample storage and integrated appliances, two generous double bedrooms, and a stylish main bathroom.\nThis superb mid-terrace home has been exceptionally well maintained and is presented in turnkey condition, offering comfortable and modern living in one of Dublin's most sought-after residential locations. Bright interiors, quality finishes, and thoughtfully designed living spaces make this an ideal home for a wide range of tenants.\nSt. Anne's in Kimmage is a highly regarded residential development, ideally situated within easy reach of Terenure, Harold's Cross, Crumlin, and Dublin City Centre. The area boasts an excellent selection of local shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, parks, and leisure facilities. There are excellent public transport links nearby, while the M50, N7, and major road networks are easily accessible, making commuting throughout Dublin and beyond both convenient and straightforward.\nThis is an excellent opportunity to secure a beautifully presented home in one of Dublin 12's most desirable residential locations. Early interest is highly recommended.\n \nAdditional Features:\nImmaculate 2 Bed / 1 Bath mid-terrace home\nBright and spacious living accommodation\nTwo generous double bedrooms\nModern fully fitted kitchen\nStylish main bathroom\nPresented in turnkey condition throughout\nExcellent transport links and easy access to Dublin City Centre, the M50, and N7\nClose to a host of local amenities\nRegister your interest today\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
